  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>- Late-arriving master data: prefer current nds.station (is_current DESC), else historical station_sk.
- "Pending" means start/end_station_id presents but there are no nds.station row at all (start/end_station_sk is empty). Hold on pending trips in staging (Dummy) + Do not upsert nds.trip.
- However, missing start/end_station_id (null/blank) is not a pending trip, we still keep loading them to NDS with null start/end_station_sk.</note>
